# PEFS Implementation Task List

> **Goal:** Build Personal Executive Function System that closes rabbit holes automatically  
> **Timeline:** 3 phases over 2 weeks  
> **Success:** 8 rabbit holes → ≤2, guilt-free operation

---

## Phase 1: Immediate Relief (This Week) 🚨

### Day 1: Closure Worksheet & Execution
- [ ] Create interactive closure worksheet for 8 rabbit holes
- [ ] User reviews and approves closure decisions
- [ ] Execute approved actions:
  - [ ] Post recruitment to r/ClaudeAI (if approved)
  - [ ] Schedule demo video recording (if approved)
  - [ ] Archive/document MCP bug (if approved)
  - [ ] Process E2E test checklist (if approved)
  - [ ] Handle remaining 4 items per user decision

### Day 2: Commitment Ledger Foundation
- [ ] Design `commitment_ledger.json` schema
- [ ] Build commitment scanner (scans artifacts for decisions/drafts/checklists)
