## Phase 3: Personal Growth (Ongoing) 🌱

### Weekly Challenge System

#### Week 1: External Work Tolerance
- [ ] Design challenge: "Post 1 thing daily for 7 days"
- [ ] Delivery mechanism (Telegram, Monday morning)
- [ ] Progress tracker (auto-detect posts)
- [ ] Reflection prompt (Friday evening)

#### Week 2: Quick Closure Habit
- [ ] Challenge: "Close ≥1 loop per day for 7 days"
- [ ] Gamification: streak counter, badges
- [ ] Analytics: closure patterns, friction points

#### Week 3: Async Coordination
- [ ] Challenge: "Schedule 1 external meeting"
- [ ] Practice: Send → Let go → Trust
- [ ] Reflection: "Did anxiety match reality?"

#### Week 4: Debugging Tolerance
- [ ] Challenge: "Fix 1 bug per day"
- [ ] Reframe: "Bugs are puzzles"
- [ ] Insight extraction: "What pattern?"

### Weekly Review Automation
- [ ] Generate Friday digest with wins, insights, next challenge
- [ ] Metrics dashboard:
  - [ ] Open rabbit holes trend
  - [ ] Mental load self-rating
  - [ ] Quick wins count
  - [ ] Guilt-free days streak
- [ ] Auto-post to `progress/` artifact folder

